WEBVTT

00:02:56.380 --> 00:03:00.676
are already building green
hydrogen-based steel production processes.

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:03.846
(Applause)

00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:08.184
That's just one of the countless
industrial processes,

00:03:08.226 --> 00:03:09.560
small and big,

00:03:09.602 --> 00:03:11.020
that need a molecule.

00:03:12.188 --> 00:03:14.857
Another example, let's say,

00:03:14.857 --> 00:03:19.779
that we can't use electricity
for everything-everything is weight.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.489
Take the aviation sector.

00:03:21.948 --> 00:03:25.534
An 80-passenger aircraft
flying on batteries.

00:03:25.993 --> 00:03:27.620
Kind of impossible.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.208
One would need more batteries
just to fly the battery.